# ConjureOS Fitness — frontend env vars (Vite exposes VITE_-prefixed vars to
# the browser as import.meta.env.VITE_*). Copy to `.env.local` for local dev.
#
# Use the SAME Supabase project as ConjureOS — that's how auth is shared. The
# anon key is safe to expose; RLS enforces per-user access. NEVER put the
# service-role key or the Anthropic key here (those live server-side).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
